<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">Cheater!</font> </strong><small>Posted Thursday, November 30, 2000 by <a href="mailto:whitefox@eqrants.com">WhiteFox</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">This is what ruins gaming... Its ruins it the most for people who are actually very good at a game. I'm going to use StarCraft as an example but it happens just as often in Counter-Strike (I'm called a cheater that is). In StarCraft... me and my pal often seek 2v3's as some of you know... now as you can imagine we get a lot of people who join the game going "Are you insane!? We gonna beat you into the ground!"<br><br>Well when its the other way around, it turns from "Are you insane!?" to "You fucking hacker!"<br><br>Even if we ask them to tell us HOW we hacked, they can't explain it... we just do. Lag is also mistaken for "hacking" now days. How stupid are these people... for real... map hacks and wall hacks and shit like that usually don't create lag... wtf!? Always get some almighty dumbass with a cable who "never lags" who starts going off about how everyone hacks the second the game slows down for  a split second... Just really pisses me off...<br><br>Set the record straight... 90% of the time lag is just that, lag. Its not created by hacks, unless its  a hack DESIGNED to lag the game, and if it is... a tiny little slow down ISN'T the hack. If your on a cable... believe it or not, you CAN lag. Suck it up, your not god. Cable does not mean you are "unlagable".<br><br>Your only as fast as your slowest link, and sometimes one of those links connecting to player so and so isn't having a good fucking day. Look at Verant... I don't know wtf they run those servers on (T1 at least) and they fucking lag every goddamn weekend...<br><br>As for hacking...ugh... just pisses me off. Like playing a game with cheat codes... what&#8217;s the mother fucking point? Its not a challenge... its not hard... and its usually not fun. About 2 weeks ago I cought someone hacking in StarCraft... I was going to attack... and my observer could see his army guarding the lower end of his base... make my way to the top, and low and behold, his army shifts position to stand between me and the base. He had no tech for observers himself, no way he could of known. I thought maybe I had been careless and let him see one of my units, so I shifted back down to the bottom of his base and his army followed... Now this just pissed me off to no end. This little dumbass hacker... trying to cheat me.  Well since he was a newbie I had been playing with him... doing the usual "play with your food" type thing... after I found he was a hacker, I kicked it into war mode and literally walked over his base 3 minutes after doing so. In the end, I made his admit he was a hacker (he was begging for an ally, also let me get screens!). He told me, it was his first time hacking. That he sucked, and he needed to try something. I let off a mountain of nasty words and told him how "His suck doesn't give him the right to cheat someone" and then wiped him off the map.<br><br>Hackers... piss... me... off... to no end. I can't stand cheating. Really is no place in my life for it... now... or ever.<br><br>Got a comment? <b><a href="http://forums.eqrants.com/showthread.php?threadid=735" target="_blank" >Click it.</a></b> </p>
