<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">Verant Interviews Absor</font> </strong><small>Posted Thursday, October 19, 2000 by <a href="mailto:buur@eqrants.com">Buur</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">I was a little shocked that someone actually took Abashi's job after he moved on up. I mean, who in their right mind would want to deal with having to read Whineplay everyday? Who would want to deal with the players complaints on a regular basis? Only a complete idiot with a <i>slight</i> masochistic streak, right?<br><br>By now, of course, we all know Absor got the job...<br><br>What you didn't know is that EQ Rants was there live for the play-by-play. Yep, we were at the VI compound during the interview and we have the details. You can read Part I of Absor's interview right <a href="http://eqrants.com/absor.html"><b>here</b></a>.<br><br>Part II and possibly Part III will follow in the days to come.</p>
