<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">Go here now</font> </strong><small>Posted Thursday, September 14, 2000 by <a href="mailto:buur@eqrants.net">Buur</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">Until I am able to come up with something EverQuesty to write about, I am going to send you over to visit <a href="http://lumthemad.net"><b>Lum the Mad</b></a>. He has a nice rant or two regarding Abashi and Whineplay. Here is a quick excerpt:<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">Gordon "Abashi" Wrinn personifies everything that is wrong with Everquest. He personally nerfed your wizard, kill-stole from your bard, and kept your druid from kiting. He plays a Necromancer, and we all know that's the only class in EQ that can actually kill things. He plays on a PvP server, and we all know about those damned PKs. He uses ShowEQ to track rare spawns, and he'll ban you from the game if you look sideways on Whineplay. He eats babies, agrees with Dick Cheney's voting record on most issues, and is probably the Antichrist.</font> <br><br>I would really, really like to have something EverQuest related to rant about right now. Honestly I would. Unfortunately Comcast@home appears to not want my business making it exceptionally hard to get online. Last night I even got crazy and decided to hook up a phone modem. WindowsME apparently wasn't too fond of it as, despite my valiant efforts, I could not get it working.<br><br>So yes, I am still netless and very much out of the EQ loop. I am trying to cover that up by endlessly rambling here on the mainpage about stuff that no one in the world could possibly care about. Hmmm...let me throw up some random stuff in the hope that you will not notice that I am not writing about EverQuest.<br><br>1) I am considering purchasing a new TV, any recommendations? I am going to look at Sony Wega TV's. Have you heard much about them?<br><br>2) I have noticed some new faces on the <a href="http://www.eqrants.net/cgi-bin/Ultimate.cgi?action=intro"><b>EQ Ranting Board</b></a>. Welcome aboard. I almost have 100 registered users for the board now. It's may not be that impressive to some, but it is impressive to me. <br><br>3) I am not wearing any pants right now.<br><br>4) Yes I am. Don't take me seriously folks.<br><br>5) It is pretty sad how dependent on the internet I have become. I wanted to see a movie the other night and couldn't look up movie showtimes because I didn't have internet access. Rather than calling the theater, I just put on the MTV Video awards for the 1,893,567th time because I couldn't be bothered to call the theater for showtimes.<br><br>6) When was the last time you saw a complete video on MTV?<br><br>7) nSync, Eminem, Britney Spears, Backstreet Boys and Christina Aguilera do not count.<br><br>8) I think I am done with this experiment. Have you forgotten you are reading an EverQuest site yet?<br><br><a href="http://www.eqrants.net/ubb/Forum7/HTML/000035.html"><b>Gratuitous comment link, in case you have something to say.</b></a> </p>
