<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">Guild Change...</font> </strong><small>Posted Wednesday, September 13, 2000 by <a href="mailto:whitefox@eqrants.com">WhiteFox</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">Verant is making it so that you can't spam in channels for people to help make your guild. Can you say, "Kiss it VI!"<br><br>Come on... Its hard as hell to get 10 people who really wanna be in your guild to all get on at the same damn time and join your channel. Probably gonna get around 20-30 people who wanna join before you actually manage to get the 10 people in a channel all at once. Not saying it&#8217;s not possible but this shit isn't easy. Especially for guilds who don't just invite anyone in, they get the worst of this. If your planning on creating an invite only guild with high stands consider your ass pre-screwed.<br><br>BS that Verant requires this at all.<br><br>On another note. Exp killing is... nasty. Nasty Nasty Nasty.<br><br>Got exp killed (guy didn't even try to get the kill, just made sure the mob won) then he trained my bind point 2 times... Oh well... He got his anyways, heard the moron ran face first into the DE camp of LF... considering how he wasn't a class with invis he either had to beg for someone to get it for him or die a few more getting it himself... either way... justice is served.<br><br>Good Morning everyone, lets see if we can get through the whole day without blowing up some school! Something to shoot for...<br></p>
