<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">Research?</font> </strong><small>Posted Saturday, September 2, 2000 by <a href="mailto:whitefox@eqrants.com">WhiteFox</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">Its not fucking research... its a gamble... you kill a mob for 5 hours straight and hope it drops a word you need. Dunno about the rest of you but I can barely stand leveling when I know I get exp every damn kill, I sure as hell am not going to camp some stupid mob on the off chance it will drop a word I need. This is one of the reasons I've barely played lately. I can't get in the mood to bash for words. I camped some level 19 orc for 4 levels... he dropped a little over 2 packs worth of words... is one of those words one that I need for my level 20 pet? Awww hell no... that would be too easy... couldn't possibly level and get the words at the same time... shit has to be SEPERATE. I could deal if certain words were dropped by certain mobs, but the current system just makes me sick. To many possible words to drop when you only need a few of them. Hell... its not even fucking work. Its just a delay for you... its raining in Texas so you can't go from NY to NC. Instead of a delay until the storm gives out its a delay until some stupid ass mob drops the words you need.<br><br>Oh well&#8230; guess I&#8217;m gonna drag myself onto EQ and see if I can do anything.<br><br><b><a href="http://www.eqrants.net/ubb/Forum7/HTML/000029.html" target="_blank" >Got a comment? You know where to click.</a></b></p>
