<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">Surprise Response</font> </strong><small>Posted Thursday, August 31, 2000 by <a href="mailto:buur@eqrants.net">Buur</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">Today I was in an e-mailing mood and I fired an e-mail off to Brad McQuaid. Now mind you, I have written to Brad probably a half a dozen times with various requests or whatever and never has he seen fit to reply. Until today.<br><br>I wrote him asking for some exclusive expansion screenshots, well here is the actual e-mail:<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">Brad,<br> <br>I was wondering if you would be so kind as to send me some exclusive screenshots for your upcoming expansion, Scars of Velious.<br> <br>I think it would be good for you to get some more screenshots out there and it would help my site.<br> <br>Thanks a lot, I anticipate the screenshots,<br> <br>Buur<br>EQ Rants<br><a href="http://eqrants.com">http://eqrants.com</a></font><br><br>Now I sent that as a total joke knowing full well that Verant would never release 'exclusive screenshots' to me. Regardless of that fact, Brad responded with:<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">we're not at a point yet where we're releasing exclusive screen shots to web sites, sorry. <br><br>--------------------------------------------- <br>Brad McQuaid <br>Vice President, Premium Games <br>Verant Interactive/Sony Online Entertainment <br>---------------------------------------------</font> <br><br>Well I guess I will be first in line when they do release them, eh? Err...probably not but it was worth a shot....</p>
