<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">The Pain of Leveling</font> </strong><small>Posted Wednesday, August 30, 2000 by <a href="mailto:whitefox@eqrants.com">WhiteFox</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">The horrors... THE HORRORS! I just spent the last 10 hours... camping one monster.... on a 10 minute spawn. Oh lord the horrors I have seen! This shit is worse than drugs man... I mean... your mind fucks itself doing this stuff... and what did I suffer through it for? Level 20... 2 crappy levels. I find the leveling system in EQ completely unacceptable. Leveling is more pain than pleasure. IT&#8217;S A GAME! I'm aware that it&#8217;s possible to group and fight stuff that spawns more... but these things aren't exactly readily available. For one, the spawns that groups go after are almost ALWAYS taken... hell, what spawn that&#8217;s worth a crap isn't? Increase the damn spawn rate Verant! Maybe if stuff pumps faster all the would be heroes won't camp in a giant circle waiting for that critter to appear. Isn't that the bad guys job? Jeez... Orc appears... looks around... shits his pants as 7 guys try to get the kill. This is one of the reasons I'm looking forward to UO2, no static spawns! NO STATIC SPAWNS! Static spawns suck. It&#8217;s to hard to find things to kill in this game. It&#8217;s not easy to get a group because there are only so many things for groups to hunt. Look at Unrest. It&#8217;s a damn town! Like 50 people sitting in the choke at all times with the occasional train. Sure, the train clears out the choke for about... 30 seconds. Makes me sick. The leveling system in EQ is just bad, I can't imagine what people on normal servers even play for because that&#8217;s all there IS to a normal server. Level level level. Trade skills? Ha. <br><br>No static spawns... like a dream after camping that punk critter for 10 hours straight. Once again, I wanna know who the moron over at Verant is who has the power to change things in this game and yet plays this game as is. They have to rate below Mayo on the fuckin IQ scale.<br><br>Oh well... Lets see if Verant says sorry for the patch today or will they wait till tomorrow? I got my cash on today ;) The stupid ass banner saying "We screwed up AGAIN, server down forever, ETA? Your guess is as good as mine" counts.<br><br><b><a href="http://www.eqrants.net/ubb/Forum7/HTML/000026.html" target="_blank" >Got Bitch?</a></b></p>
