<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">Watch your rear</font> </strong><small>Posted Tuesday, August 22, 2000 by <a href="mailto:buur@eqrants.net">Buur</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">I normally don't post regurgitated Abashi comments, but this one is worth the time. I don't want to see my fine readers become infected and stuff.<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">Hello all,<br>Another scam has been found. Someone has put up a web page offering a utility called the "EverQuest Connection Enhancer". This is actually a program that installs a backdoor virus (Norton: Backdoor.SubSeven) that will allow people access to your EverQuest login information as well as other private information on your system. We are going to try to get the site closed down.<br><br>As always, we recommend that you do not use any programs from an untrusted source.<br><br>-Gordon</font><br><br>Obviously there is no link to the site, but if you come across this program you may want to, like, delete it or something.</p>
