<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">What I have decided.</font> </strong><small>Posted Thursday, August 17, 2000 by <a href="mailto:buur@eqrants.net">Buur</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">Ok, here are the details for the guild. Right now the plan is to start on the Torvonnilous server on the continent of Faydwer. It was determined by myself and my closest confidants, my Charmander and Darth Maul figures, that those are the best choices.<br><br>We currently have no name for the guild, so we will have to discuss what we want it to be called. I will be playing a ranger named Buur, because I fear change. You can discuss what you want to play in this  <a href="http://www.eqrants.net/ubb/Forum7/HTML/000017.html"><b>thread</b></a>. Also use that thread for guild name suggestions.<br><br>If you would like to play a race that isn't located on Faydwer, you are free to do so. You will just have to make him/her soon and move him/her to Faydwer before we get started. I would like to get started tomorrow, as I should be home from work. If that isn't possible then at least by Sunday. If all goes well, I will have a guild page up by Sunday. That way I can stop posting this stuff here.<br><br>That is all for now.</p>
