<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">A whole lot of nothing...</font> </strong><small>Posted Wednesday, July 26, 2000 by <a href="mailto:buur@eqrants.net">Buur</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">There hasn't been a whole lot for me to talk about the last couple of days. There's just not a lot of EQ related news out there, although I am sure Gordon said something that was covered by at least 5 different sites. And I am pretty sure at least one of the Gordon items went like this:<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">r33t Camper: Gordon, Monks suck at level 60! We are worthless and no one wants us in a group! We are supposed to be the king of melee damage! Do something you lying piece of *!&*#!!!</font> <br><br><font color="#FFFF00">Gordon: We've investigated your claim and determined that...MONKS ROCK!</font><br><br>---<br><br>In other EQ news, oh wait, I said earlier that there isn't any EQ news. I did log on for a bit last night though, and kind of remembered what made me quit in the first place. If you can't find a group, and you have to solo, you are going to have an awful lot of downtime. I can think of probably 1000 things that are better then staring at a spellbook waiting for mana to recharge, and that is just off the top of my head. I am sure there are closer to a million things that are actually better, including pulling my toenails out with a pair of needlenose pliers.<br><br>---<br><br>I am still up in the air regarding the whole "additional ranters" thing. I got some very nice e-mails from people who don't want to see that at all. I appreciate your kind words, because kind words are, you know, better then unkind words. Maybe instead of new ranters I can just add some new sections or something. What would you guys like to see? This site is here for you and I am open to your suggestions.<br><br>Enough of my rambling, time to do some work. If you wanna talk amongst yourselves you know where the board is by now. I am too lazy to leave a link.</p>
