<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">Patch rant</font> </strong><small>Posted Thursday, July 20, 2000 by <a href="mailto:buur@eqrants.net">Buur</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">Yesterday was one of those days that all EQ geeks live for. Patch day! Patch day gives me a great opportunity to do a patch rant, as it is rather hard to do one when they haven't released a new patch. Don't ask me why, it is just one of those weird things.<br><br>I'll only be running down the things that I feel are worth mentioning. I am sure you can find the full details at other sites.<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">*Miscellaneous Changes/Fixes*</font><br><br><font color="#FFFF00">- Rangers above level 50 will now do double damage with Archery against non-moving, non-rooted targets. These restrictions allowed us to enhance archery without creating a new kiting problem.</font> <br><br>- So if you happen to catch a MOB sitting down taking a lunch break, or just stopping for a smoke, fire away! Of course when he gets pissed and starts moving, you are screwed. I would be mad too, if you interrupted my lunch.<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">- A large rat says, "Hit by non-melee for XXX damage", is history. The new message given probably isn't the source of never-ending humor that the old one was.</font> <br><br>Now the message is "You hit me you A-Hole!" Obviously not a joke as the rat is seriously upset about getting hurt.<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">- Corrected many, many, MANY spelling and grammar errors in the world.</font> <br><br>Thta si god. Noting tiks me of mor len gramatikil erors.<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">*/consent*<br><br>Some people were spamming others with /consent, causing them to disconnect. As a result, /consent can now only be done once every two seconds. Should you be harassed via this tool, please use /report. Also, please take care to avoid accidentally /consenting someone, as it will be two seconds before you can undo it.</font> <br><br>No, consent does not give you permission to cyber your favorite female playing male. This is a different kind of consent. Just thought I should clear that up.<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">*Barbed Scale Whip*<br><br>In the last item patch, this item was changed from its original stats to something inferior, as the game designer was not aware that it was already in-game. It has been changed back to its original stats.</font> <br><br>Right. You see what we are dealing with here. Just to let them know, there is also something called banded armor, and there is this boat that goes from Butcherblock to Freeport, and a whole continent called Kunark. Next time you are not sure if something is, you know, in the game...just ask and I will be sure to let you know.<br><br><font color="#FFFF00">- The EverQuest Team</font> <br><br>- The EQ Rants Team</p>
