<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">Fixed Boards</font> </strong><small>Posted Tuesday, July 18, 2000 by <a href="mailto:buur@eqrants.net">Buur</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">I just realized that I managed to totally mess up the <a href="http://www.eqrants.net/cgi-bin/Ultimate.cgi?action=intro"><b>Ranting Board</b></a>. No one was able to register or access their profile. I apologize if anyone tried to register yesterday and was unable to (Although that doesn't seem very likely. That someone would try and register for the board that is). I realized what a dumn mistake I made and corrected it. I also realized I should just leave well enough alone.<br><br>Although I probably won't. There will probably new board hacks soon, as soon as I can find some worth the effort.</p>
