<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">I am dumb</font> </strong><small>Posted Thursday, July 6, 2000 by <a href="mailto:buur@eqrants.net">Buur</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">Today I went against every ounce of common sense I have. I went against everything that was telling me I shouldn't do it. I boldly went where...err...nevermind that one.<br><br>I purchased Diablo II.<br><br>Many of you probably have Diablo II by now. It is the feel good sensation of the summer to a lot of people. To me it represents more hours sitting in front of my computer slowly going blind from the monitor radiation. But I have to know what all the craze is about. I am doing this for you. Yes, for the loyal readers. Now I have something else to whine, bitch and complain about. I am also blaming this on you, the loyal readers. At the end of the summer, when my skin is a pasty white color and I smell god awful, I hope you will all feel good about yourselves.<br><br><a href="http://www.eqrants.net/ubb/Forum4/HTML/000001.html"><b>What the hell, let's throw up another board that no one will use</b></a> </p>
