<p><font face="Arial" size="4" color="#4E657C">I tried...</font> </strong><small>Posted Tuesday, July 4, 2000 by <a href="mailto:worthles@eqrants.net">worthless</a></small><br><font face="Arial" size="3">I've looked and looked for something to post, something to comment on... but the truth is there is no Everquest news that isn't already on 5 other websites. We try our best here to not be like everyone else, so I refuse to post regurgitated Abashi posts (unless of course I have something to add or comment about). These other sites are making a ton of cash by copying and pasting. It's a shame really, it doesn't take any skill or talent to take other peoples words and place them on a page. EQrants may suck, but at least it's mostly original content. Now if only we had more than one reader (Hi Mecha!), that might mean something ehhe.<br><br>It's the Fourth of July, and I'll be home sleeping. I'm not big on Holidays ;) Buur is still away, he has outlasted all bets and made it 5 days without a computer! Hope he's having fun out there. Hope you are all having fun too! Have a safe holiday, and be careful with those fireworks. <a href="http://www.worthless.net/alabamaman2.jpg">Alabama Man</a> says "Beer n firewerks dunt mix!"</p>
